      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/BackgroundJob/FaceRecognitionBackgroundTask.php:31 OCA\\FaceRecognition\\BackgroundJob\\IFaceRecognitionBackgroundTask, by its path OCA\\FaceRecognition\\BackgroundJob\\FaceRecognitionBackgroundTask"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 class in lib/ whose name does not follow PSR-4 below OCA\\FaceRecognition, the namespace the server derives from <namespace> of info.xml. The loader of the server does not find such a class.",
        "  lib/BackgroundJob/FaceRecognitionBackgroundTask.php:31 OCA\\FaceRecognition\\BackgroundJob\\IFaceRecognitionBackgroundTask, by its path OCA\\FaceRecognition\\BackgroundJob\\FaceRecognitionBackgroundTask"
      ]
